  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-035-wangdao-source:zhengwen" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-035-wangdao-source:zhengwen:m0000" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAA">王丞相</persName>有幸妾姓<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-035-wangdao-source:zhengwen:m0007" ref="wv1_vsj_6xy">雷</persName>，頗預政事納貨。<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-035-wangdao-source:zhengwen:m0016" ref="b98_957_r7h">蔡公</persName>謂之「<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-035-wangdao-source:zhengwen:m0021" ref="wv1_vsj_6xy">雷尚書</persName>」。</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-035-wangdao-source:yulin" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-035-wangdao-source:yulin:m0000" ref="wv1_vsj_6xy">雷</persName>有寵，生<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-035-wangdao-source:yulin:m0005" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAC">恬</persName>、<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-035-wangdao-source:yulin:m0007" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAA">洽</persName>。</p>
